      "name": "About Us Section 1",
      "settings": {
        "heading": "Welcome to My Pahadi Dukan",
        "description": "<p><strong>My Pahadi Dukan</strong> brings the authentic taste, traditions, and craftsmanship of the Himalayas closer to you. We work with passionate local entrepreneurs and communities to bring you indigenous, high-quality, and unadulterated products sourced directly from the mountains.</p><p>Our aim is to create a trusted connection between Himalayan producers and conscious consumers across India—making authentic Himalayan products more accessible while ensuring better opportunities and income for the people who create them.</p><p>Rooted in <strong>transparency, quality, purity, authenticity, and customer service</strong>, we believe every product should carry the true essence of its origin. From the mountains to your doorstep, <strong>My Pahadi Dukan is committed to bringing you genuine Himalayan goodness with purpose and integrity.</strong></p>",
